Z||000000||88 Database Nut||09-25-2001||01:55 PM||||Well, I am happy to report that the factory blue '85SE has been safely removed from the junkyard and is now sitting in my driveway!  I didn't think it would happen, but thanks to the understanding owners and managers at the Pull-A-Part company here in Atlanta, this car  has survived and WILL BE ROADWORTHY AGAIN!  <BR>Many thanks to all who contributed to the previous thread, and stay tuned for pics soon.<P>John Willhoff, happy Database Nut!||||reg||1
